      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SLICK BADGER (4) made light work of a wide draw last time with a slick early sectional but gathered in and had to settle for the minors, finishing third (26.07) at this track over 460m. Can find winning form. JOROGUMO (2) was unfavoured last start but led all the way to score by half a length (29.61) at Sandown in a Free For All over 515m. Strong form has emerged from his last run. One of main contenders. SHE'S PRIMED (1) has a strong record here with four wins and five placings from 12 starts. Hit the frame latest (30.10) when third at Sandown in a Grade 4/5. With even luck and a clean start can sneak into the finish. ZIPPING KRISTOFF (3) has ability and must be included among the main hopes.",
